1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,623
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yordam bering, iltimos. Yapon tilida SOS!

2
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:15,900
Videoning qaysidir joyida yapon tilida savol chiqadi. Eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

3
00:00:17,808 --> 00:00:19,680
Sahna 1: Yo‘qolgan buyumga munosabat / Yo‘qolgan narsalar bilan ishlash

4
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,014
Kechirasiz.

5
00:00:22,038 --> 00:00:24,571
Ha, nima bo‘ldi?

6
00:00:24,594 --> 00:00:30,565
Poyezdda sumkamni unutib qoldim.

7
00:00:30,589 --> 00:00:33,922
E, sumkami?

8
00:00:33,945 --> 00:00:36,778
Bu juda yomon bo‘ldi-ku.

9
00:00:36,801 --> 00:00:41,135
Ha, juda muammoga duch keldim.

10
00:00:41,158 --> 00:00:44,235
Qaysi poyezdda bo‘lgansiz?

11
00:00:44,258 --> 00:00:47,091
Qaysi poyezd?

12
00:00:47,114 --> 00:00:51,281
Kechirasiz, yaxshi tushunmadim.

13
00:00:51,304 --> 00:00:54,304
Yashil rangli poyezd.

14
00:00:54,327 --> 00:00:57,805
Yashil rangli poyezd, shundaymi?

15
00:00:57,828 --> 00:01:00,116
Yamanote liniyasi bo‘lmasmi?

16
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:02,873
Yamanote liniyasi?

17
00:01:02,896 --> 00:01:07,107
Kechirasiz, so‘zlarni tushunmayapman.

18
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:11,164
Tokiodagi aylana liniya.

19
00:01:11,187 --> 00:01:13,641
A, ha, shunday.

20
00:01:13,664 --> 00:01:16,464
Aylana poyezd.

21
00:01:16,487 --> 00:01:19,891
Poyezd soat nechada va necha minutda edi?

22
00:01:19,915 --> 00:01:25,115
12:10 da bu yerga yetib keldim.

23
00:01:25,138 --> 00:01:27,905
12:10 da, shundaymi?

24
00:01:27,928 --> 00:01:30,694
Qaysi vagonda bo‘lgansiz?

25
00:01:30,717 --> 00:01:33,984
Qaysi vagon?

26
00:01:34,007 --> 00:01:37,774
Kechirasiz, bilmayman.

27
00:01:37,797 --> 00:01:41,063
Poyezdning eng oldi tomoni?

28
00:01:41,086 --> 00:01:43,383
O‘rtasimi?

29
00:01:43,407 --> 00:01:47,247
A, eng oldi tomoni.

30
00:01:47,271 --> 00:01:50,271
Oldingi eshikdan chiqdim.

31
00:01:50,294 --> 00:01:53,861
Sumkani qayerga qo‘ydingiz?

32
00:01:53,884 --> 00:01:56,089
Javon ustiga...

33
00:01:56,113 --> 00:01:59,313
Javon ustiga qo‘ydim.

34
00:01:59,336 --> 00:02:01,669
Sumka qanday ko‘rinishda?

35
00:02:01,692 --> 00:02:05,225
Qora ryukzak.

36
00:02:05,248 --> 00:02:08,982
O‘lchami qanday?

37
00:02:09,005 --> 00:02:11,771
Bunday kattalikda.

38
00:02:11,794 --> 00:02:14,628
U anchagina katta emas.

39
00:02:14,651 --> 00:02:18,229
Ustida belgi bormi?

40
00:02:18,253 --> 00:02:24,106
Belgi... a, oq yulduz bor.

41
00:02:24,129 --> 00:02:27,562
Ichida nima bor?

42
00:02:27,585 --> 00:02:32,224
Pasport va hamyonim bor.

43
00:02:32,248 --> 00:02:35,381
Pasportsiz qiyin bo‘ladi-ku.

44
00:02:35,404 --> 00:02:39,004
Ha, yo‘q.

45
00:02:39,027 --> 00:02:42,960
Pasportsiz juda muammoga duch kelaman.

46
00:02:42,983 --> 00:02:44,784
Tushunarli.

47
00:02:44,807 --> 00:02:49,048
Hozir keyingi bekatga aloqaga chiqaman.

48
00:02:49,072 --> 00:02:51,239
Iltimos, yordam bering.

49
00:02:51,262 --> 00:02:54,329
Stulga o‘tirib kutib turing.

50
00:02:54,352 --> 00:02:58,118
Ha, shu yerda kutaman.

51
00:02:58,141 --> 00:03:02,475
Ismingiz va telefon raqamingizni aytib bera olasizmi?

52
00:03:02,499 --> 00:03:05,111
Men Mariya.

53
00:03:05,134 --> 00:03:14,610
Telefon raqamim 090-1234-5678.

54
00:03:14,634 --> 00:03:16,573
Mariya xonim, shundaymi?

55
00:03:16,596 --> 00:03:20,196
Tez orada tekshirib chiqaman, xavotir olmang.

56
00:03:20,219 --> 00:03:22,794
Tashakkur.

57
00:03:22,817 --> 00:03:29,922
Bugungi videodagi darslarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

58
00:03:29,922 --> 00:03:31,422
2-Sahna: Yoʻl koʻrsatish va telefonni zaryadlash / Yoʻl va Telefon Zaryadi

59
00:03:31,422 --> 00:03:33,692
Uzr, iltimos.

60
00:03:33,715 --> 00:03:36,515
Ha, nima uchun?

61
00:03:36,538 --> 00:03:40,072
Yoʻlni… bilmayman.

62
00:03:40,095 --> 00:03:42,786
Qayerga bormoqchisiz?

63
00:03:42,809 --> 00:03:46,142
Sakura kasalxonasiga borishni istayman.

64
00:03:46,165 --> 00:03:48,899
Sakura kasalxonasi, shundaymi?

65
00:03:48,922 --> 00:03:53,055
Ha, bu yerdan uzoqmi?

66
00:03:53,078 --> 00:03:57,173
Yoʻq, uzoq emas.

67
00:03:57,197 --> 00:04:02,364
Smartfonimda tekshirmoqchiman, lekin bu ishlamayapti.

68
00:04:02,387 --> 00:04:04,682
Nima boʻldi?

69
00:04:04,705 --> 00:04:06,579
Zaryad?

70
00:04:06,603 --> 00:04:09,173
Elektr tugab qoldi.

71
00:04:09,196 --> 00:04:11,997
Ekran butkul qorongʻi.

72
00:04:12,021 --> 00:04:16,699
A, zaryad tugagan ekan.

73
00:04:16,722 --> 00:04:19,656
Bu muammo ekan.

74
00:04:19,679 --> 00:04:24,246
Ha, joyni umuman bilmayman.

75
00:04:24,269 --> 00:04:28,002
Shu yerdan toʻgʻri boring.

76
00:04:28,025 --> 00:04:30,225
Toʻgʻri, shundaymi?

77
00:04:30,248 --> 00:04:35,668
Ha, birinchi svetoforni oʻngga buriling.

78
00:04:35,691 --> 00:04:37,625
Svetofor…?

79
00:04:37,648 --> 00:04:41,648
Uzr, svetofor nima?

80
00:04:41,671 --> 00:04:44,755
Qizil va yashil chiroqlar.

81
00:04:44,778 --> 00:04:47,745
Mashinalar toʻxtaydi.

82
00:04:47,769 --> 00:04:50,202
A, tushunarli.

83
00:04:50,225 --> 00:04:53,958
Birinchi chiroqni oʻngga, shundaymi?

84
00:04:53,981 --> 00:04:55,982
Ha, toʻgʻri.

85
00:04:56,005 --> 00:04:59,488
Oʻngga burilsangiz, bank boʻladi.

86
00:04:59,512 --> 00:05:01,312
Bank?

87
00:05:01,335 --> 00:05:04,135
Pul bilan ishlaydigan joymi?

88
00:05:04,158 --> 00:05:06,891
Ha, shunday.

89
00:05:06,914 --> 00:05:12,126
Bank yonida katta oq bino bor.

90
00:05:12,150 --> 00:05:15,883
Yonida oq bino, shundaymi?

91
00:05:15,906 --> 00:05:20,981
Ha, oʻsha binoning birinchi qavati Sakura kasalxonasi.

92
00:05:21,005 --> 00:05:23,571
Birinchi qavat…

93
00:05:23,594 --> 00:05:25,528
Tushunarli.

94
00:05:25,551 --> 00:05:28,166
Piyoda necha daqiqa ketadi?

95
00:05:28,189 --> 00:05:31,122
5 daqiqa atrofida.

96
00:05:31,145 --> 00:05:33,158
5 daqiqa, shundaymi?

97
00:05:33,182 --> 00:05:38,042
Hozir yomgʻir yogʻyapti, ehtiyot boʻling.

98
00:05:38,065 --> 00:05:39,799
Tashakkur.

99
00:05:39,822 --> 00:05:45,555
Kasalxona oldida yashil rangli katta reklama taxtasi ham bor.

100
00:05:45,578 --> 00:05:47,145
Reklama taxtasi?

101
00:05:47,168 --> 00:05:51,171
Uzr, reklama taxtasi nima ekanini tushunmadim.

102
00:05:51,194 --> 00:05:56,027
Ism yozilgan katta qogʻoz yoki taxta.

103
00:05:56,050 --> 00:05:59,089
Oh, imzo kerakmi?

104
00:05:59,113 --> 00:06:01,080
Tushunarli.

105
00:06:01,103 --> 00:06:02,948
Hozir boraman.

106
00:06:02,971 --> 00:06:05,505
Ehtiyot boʻling, ketayotganingizda.

107
00:06:05,528 --> 00:06:09,306
Rostdan ham katta rahmat.

108
00:06:09,329 --> 00:06:14,646
Eslab qoldiysizmi? Izoh qoldiring.

109
00:06:14,646 --> 00:06:16,146
3-SAHNA: Doʻstingizni qanday topish mumkin / Yoʻqolgan doʻstingizni topish yoʻllari

110
00:06:16,146 --> 00:06:19,079
Uzr, iltimos.

111
00:06:19,102 --> 00:06:21,969
Ha, nima uchun murojaat qilyapsiz?

112
00:06:21,992 --> 00:06:24,525
Doʻstim yoʻq.

113
00:06:24,548 --> 00:06:27,402
Qayerda yoʻqoldingiz?

114
00:06:27,426 --> 00:06:29,904
Yoʻqoldimmi…?

115
00:06:29,927 --> 00:06:34,171
Kechirasiz, tushunmadim.

116
00:06:34,194 --> 00:06:38,283
Doʻstingiz bilan qayerda ajralib qoldingiz?

117
00:06:38,306 --> 00:06:41,873
Ana oʻsha doʻkon oldida.

118
00:06:41,896 --> 00:06:44,929
Doʻstingiz qanday odam?

119
00:06:44,952 --> 00:06:48,596
Baland boʻyli erkak.

120
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:51,226
U qanday rangli kiyim kiygan?

121
00:06:51,249 --> 00:06:54,730
Koʻk rangli futbolka kiygan.

122
00:06:54,754 --> 00:06:57,200
Shimining rangi qanaqa?

123
00:06:57,223 --> 00:07:00,361
Qora shim kiygan.

124
00:07:00,385 --> 00:07:03,419
Doʻstingizning ismi nima?

125
00:07:03,442 --> 00:07:05,808
Jon.

126
00:07:05,831 --> 00:07:09,465
Jon yapon tilini biladimi?

127
00:07:09,488 --> 00:07:12,862
Yoʻq, umuman bilmaydi.

128
00:07:12,885 --> 00:07:15,764
Bu haqiqatan ham tashvishli.

129
00:07:15,787 --> 00:07:20,191
Ha, telefon ham aloqa bermayapti.

130
00:07:20,214 --> 00:07:24,081
Jon qalpoq kiyganmi?

131
00:07:24,104 --> 00:07:28,104
Ha, oq qalpoq kiygan.

132
00:07:28,127 --> 00:07:30,777
Sumka olganmi?

133
00:07:30,801 --> 00:07:33,834
Jigarrang sumka olgan.

134
00:07:33,857 --> 00:07:37,794
Tushunarli, ichki eʼlon beramiz.

135
00:07:37,818 --> 00:07:40,351
Ichki eʼlonmi…?

136
00:07:40,374 --> 00:07:45,174
Karnay orqali Jonning ismini chaqiramiz.

137
00:07:45,197 --> 00:07:47,485
Iltimos, qiling.

138
00:07:47,509 --> 00:07:50,924
Bu yerga ismingizni yozing.

139
00:07:50,947 --> 00:07:53,780
Ha, yozdim.

140
00:07:53,803 --> 00:07:57,537
Tugaguncha shu yerda kutib turing.

141
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,893
Tashakkur.

142
00:07:59,916 --> 00:08:01,416
4-SAHNA: Toʻlov paytidagi muammo / Toʻlovda duch kelgan muammolar

143
00:08:01,416 --> 00:08:03,069
Kechirasiz.

144
00:08:03,093 --> 00:08:05,662
Hisobni toʻlashni iltimos qilaman.

145
00:08:05,685 --> 00:08:07,088
Ha.

146
00:08:07,112 --> 00:08:10,752
Jami 2500 yen.

147
00:08:10,775 --> 00:08:12,020
Ha.

148
00:08:12,044 --> 00:08:14,054
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

149
00:08:14,078 --> 00:08:15,487
Ha.

150
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,809
A, bu…

151
00:08:16,832 --> 00:08:19,273
Hamyonim yoʻq.

152
00:08:19,296 --> 00:08:22,663
Sumkangizda yoʻqmi?

153
00:08:22,686 --> 00:08:26,486
Sumkamda… yoʻq.

154
00:08:26,509 --> 00:08:28,563
Nima qilsam?

155
00:08:28,586 --> 00:08:31,520
Kredit kartangiz bormi?

156
00:08:31,543 --> 00:08:35,509
Karta ham hamyonda.

157
00:08:35,532 --> 00:08:39,104
Telefon orqali toʻlash mumkinmi?

158
00:08:39,128 --> 00:08:43,304
Telefonimda pul yoʻq.

159
00:08:43,327 --> 00:08:45,766
Muammoga duch keldik.

160
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:48,361
Rostdan ham uzr so'raymiz,

161
00:08:48,384 --> 00:08:50,617
pulim yo'q.

162
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:54,440
Bugun kimdir bilan birga kelganmisiz?

163
00:08:54,463 --> 00:08:57,230
Yo'q, yolg'izman.

164
00:08:57,253 --> 00:09:00,686
Yaqin atrofingizda do'stlaringiz yashaydimi?

165
00:09:00,709 --> 00:09:02,109
Ha,

166
00:09:02,132 --> 00:09:05,699
do'stim yaqin atrofdagi kompaniyada.

167
00:09:05,722 --> 00:09:09,759
Do'stingizga qo'ng'iroq qila olasizmi?

168
00:09:09,782 --> 00:09:11,216
Ha,

169
00:09:11,239 --> 00:09:13,306
Qo'ng'iroq qilaman.

170
00:09:13,329 --> 00:09:15,262
Ma'lum boldi,

171
00:09:15,285 --> 00:09:17,218
qo'ng'iroq qilib ko'ring.

172
00:09:17,241 --> 00:09:21,679
Allo, Ken, yordam bering!

173
00:09:21,703 --> 00:09:25,389
Do'konga pul olib keling.

174
00:09:25,412 --> 00:09:28,145
Do'stingiz keloladimi?

175
00:09:28,168 --> 00:09:29,643
Ha.

176
00:09:29,667 --> 00:09:33,037
Hozir shu yerga keladi.

177
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:34,798
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

178
00:09:34,822 --> 00:09:37,555
Shunda shu yerda kutib turing.

179
00:09:37,578 --> 00:09:40,270
Rostdan uzr so'raymiz.

180
00:09:40,293 --> 00:09:41,793
5-Sahna: Xonada kalitni unutib qoldirish / Xonada kalitni unutib qoldirish holatlariga javob berish

181
00:09:41,793 --> 00:09:44,626
Afsuski, uzr so'rayman,

182
00:09:44,649 --> 00:09:46,783
qabulxona shu yerda mi?

183
00:09:46,807 --> 00:09:49,773
Ha, qabulxonamiz.

184
00:09:49,796 --> 00:09:51,763
Nima boʻldi?

185
00:09:51,786 --> 00:09:56,121
Xonaning kalitini ichkariga qoldirib ketdim.

186
00:09:56,144 --> 00:10:00,883
Kalitni ichkariga qoldirib, eshikni yopib qo'ydingizmi?

187
00:10:00,907 --> 00:10:04,440
Ha, eshik yopildi.

188
00:10:04,463 --> 00:10:06,663
Ochilmayapti.

189
00:10:06,686 --> 00:10:08,853
Ichkariga kirib qolgan (inlok) holat.

190
00:10:08,876 --> 00:10:10,649
Tushunarli.

191
00:10:10,672 --> 00:10:12,885
Inlok...?

192
00:10:12,909 --> 00:10:15,581
Kechirasiz,

193
00:10:15,604 --> 00:10:18,051
bu so'zning ma'nosini tushunmadim.

194
00:10:18,074 --> 00:10:20,307
Hech qisi yo'q,

195
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:22,599
bu tez-tez uchraydigan muammo.

196
00:10:22,623 --> 00:10:25,870
Hozir koridorda turibman.

197
00:10:25,894 --> 00:10:28,627
Xonangizning raqami nechchi?

198
00:10:28,650 --> 00:10:31,850
305-xona.

199
00:10:31,873 --> 00:10:35,529
305-xonadagi Mariya sizmisiz?

200
00:10:35,553 --> 00:10:38,197
Ha, shunday.

201
00:10:38,221 --> 00:10:40,503
Hozir boraman.

202
00:10:40,526 --> 00:10:42,224
Tashakkur,

203
00:10:42,247 --> 00:10:44,614
tezroq keling.

204
00:10:44,637 --> 00:10:47,682
Master-kalitni olib boraman.

205
00:10:47,706 --> 00:10:50,375
Master-kalit?

206
00:10:50,398 --> 00:10:52,970
Maxsus kalit,

207
00:10:52,993 --> 00:10:55,207
eshikni ochishi mumkin.

208
00:10:55,231 --> 00:10:58,397
A, tushunarli.

209
00:10:58,420 --> 00:11:01,393
Koridor bir oz sovuq emasmi?

210
00:11:01,417 --> 00:11:05,019
Ha, bir oz sovuq.

211
00:11:05,042 --> 00:11:08,414
Tezroq boraman, shu yerda kutib turing.

212
00:11:08,438 --> 00:11:12,271
Ha, eshik oldida kutaman.

213
00:11:12,294 --> 00:11:13,794
6-Sahna: Kasallik paytidagi javob / Kasallik paytida qanday javob berish kerak

214
00:11:13,794 --> 00:11:15,728
Kechirasiz.

215
00:11:15,751 --> 00:11:19,122
Qorni juda qattiq og'riyapti.

216
00:11:19,145 --> 00:11:21,379
Yaxshimisiz?

217
00:11:21,402 --> 00:11:24,402
Yuzingiz yaxshi koʻrinmayapti.

218
00:11:24,424 --> 00:11:27,916
Ertalabdan beri doim ogʻriyapti.

219
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:30,575
Isitmangiz bormi?

220
00:11:30,598 --> 00:11:35,469
Yaqinda oʻlchadim, 38 darajaga yetdi.

221
00:11:35,492 --> 00:11:38,026
Bu juda yomon.

222
00:11:38,049 --> 00:11:40,382
Kasalxonaga boring.

223
00:11:40,405 --> 00:11:44,383
Yaqin atrofda katta kasalxona bormi?

224
00:11:44,406 --> 00:11:46,022
Ha.

225
00:11:46,046 --> 00:11:48,700
Vokzal yaqinida bor.

226
00:11:48,723 --> 00:11:52,557
Piyoda borish mumkinmi?

227
00:11:52,579 --> 00:11:55,979
Yoʻq, piyoda yurish qiyin.

228
00:11:56,002 --> 00:11:58,697
Taksini chaqiraman.

229
00:11:58,721 --> 00:12:00,409
Iltimos.

230
00:12:00,432 --> 00:12:03,249
Juda ogʻriyapti.

231
00:12:03,273 --> 00:12:06,039
Koʻnglingiz ayniyaptimi?

232
00:12:06,062 --> 00:12:11,029
Koʻngil aynishi... Kechirasiz, tushunmadim.

233
00:12:11,052 --> 00:12:15,385
Qorin ichidagi narsalarni chiqarmoqchimisiz?

234
00:12:15,408 --> 00:12:19,342
Yoʻq, bu muammo emas.

235
00:12:19,365 --> 00:12:22,839
Lekin boshim aylanmoqda.

236
00:12:22,862 --> 00:12:24,904
Tushunarli.

237
00:12:24,927 --> 00:12:27,346
Shu yerda oʻtiring.

238
00:12:27,369 --> 00:12:29,003
Tashakkur.

239
00:12:29,026 --> 00:12:33,459
Sugʻurta polisi yoki pasportingiz bormi?

240
00:12:33,482 --> 00:12:35,449
Sugʻurta polisi?

241
00:12:35,472 --> 00:12:40,157
Kasalxonada ishlatiladigan muhim karta.

242
00:12:40,180 --> 00:12:43,347
Ah, kartam yoʻq.

243
00:12:43,370 --> 00:12:46,536
Pasportim sumkada.

244
00:12:46,559 --> 00:12:48,893
Yaxshi boʻldi.

245
00:12:48,916 --> 00:12:51,116
Taksi keldi.

246
00:12:51,138 --> 00:12:53,172
Tashakkur.

247
00:12:53,195 --> 00:12:54,695
7-Sahna: Kutilmagan Yomgʻirdan Pana Topish

248
00:12:54,695 --> 00:12:59,495
Voy, birdan yomgʻir yogʻa boshladi!

249
00:12:59,518 --> 00:13:03,518
Rostdan ham. Juda kuchli yogʻyapti.

250
00:13:03,541 --> 00:13:07,107
Menda soyabon yoʻq.

251
00:13:07,130 --> 00:13:11,330
Menda ham yoʻq. Qiyin boʻldi-ku.

252
00:13:11,353 --> 00:13:15,753
Shu yerda biroz yomgʻirdan saqlanaylik.

253
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:18,143
Ha, toʻgʻri.

254
00:13:18,166 --> 00:13:21,933
Lekin, toʻxtamaydigandek.

255
00:13:21,956 --> 00:13:25,289
Vokzalgacha qancha masofa bor?

256
00:13:25,312 --> 00:13:29,316
Bu yerdan piyoda oʻn besh daqiqa.

257
00:13:29,339 --> 00:13:32,630
Oʻn besh daqiqa uzoq ekan.

258
00:13:32,654 --> 00:13:34,220
Hovuchdamiz.

259
00:13:34,243 --> 00:13:37,677
Yaqin atrofda doʻkon bor.

260
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:41,433
Doʻkonda soyabon sotadimi?

261
00:13:41,456 --> 00:13:45,307
Ha, plastik soyabonlar bor.

262
00:13:45,331 --> 00:13:47,664
Plastik soyabon?

263
00:13:47,687 --> 00:13:52,221
Oq rangli, arzon plastik soyabon.

264
00:13:52,244 --> 00:13:54,889
A, tushunarli.

265
00:13:54,912 --> 00:13:58,146
Doʻkon qayerda?

266
00:13:58,169 --> 00:14:02,102
U burchakni aylang, darhol koʻrasiz.

267
00:14:02,125 --> 00:14:05,170
Yugursak bir daqiqa davom etadimi?

268
00:14:05,194 --> 00:14:09,481
Ha, juda yaqin, shuning uchun yuguraylik.

269
00:14:09,504 --> 00:14:11,237
Tushunarli.

270
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:13,194
Tayyormisiz?

271
00:14:13,217 --> 00:14:15,817
Ha, boramiz!

272
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,573
Yuguramiz.

273
00:14:17,596 --> 00:14:19,683
Shoshilaylik.

274
00:14:19,706 --> 00:14:21,206
Sahna 8: Yo‘qolgan narsalarni tekshirish

275
00:14:21,206 --> 00:14:23,102
Kechirasiz.

276
00:14:23,126 --> 00:14:26,782
Oldingi taksining haydovchisi edi, shundaymi?

277
00:14:26,805 --> 00:14:30,609
Ha, shunday, nima bo‘ldi?

278
00:14:30,633 --> 00:14:34,600
Pasportimni yo‘qotgan bo‘lishim mumkin.

279
00:14:34,623 --> 00:14:37,463
Mashinada bo‘lganmi?

280
00:14:37,486 --> 00:14:41,536
O‘rindiqda yoki pol ustida bo‘lishi mumkin deb o‘ylayman.

281
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,595
Tushunarli.

282
00:14:43,619 --> 00:14:47,055
Orqadagi o‘rindiqqa bir qarayman.

283
00:14:47,078 --> 00:14:48,777
Iltimos.

284
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,267
Haqiqatan ham qiynalayapman.

285
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:55,265
A, o‘rindiq tagida biror narsa bor.

286
00:14:55,288 --> 00:14:57,255
Rostdanmi?

287
00:14:57,278 --> 00:14:59,094
Ko‘rsatib bering.

288
00:14:59,118 --> 00:15:01,151
Bu-mi?

289
00:15:01,174 --> 00:15:03,974
Qizil daftar kabi narsa.

290
00:15:03,997 --> 00:15:08,442
Yo‘q, bu mening daftarim emas.

291
00:15:08,465 --> 00:15:12,322
Unda eshik cho‘ntagiga qarab ko‘raylik.

292
00:15:12,346 --> 00:15:14,397
Topdingizmi?

293
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:18,063
Yo‘q, bu yerda yo‘q ekan.

294
00:15:18,087 --> 00:15:20,053
Nima qilsam?

295
00:15:20,076 --> 00:15:23,760
Pasportsiz samolyotga chiqa olmayman.

296
00:15:23,783 --> 00:15:28,017
Sumkani yana bir bor tekshirib ko‘ring.

297
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:31,378
Sumkani avvalroq ko‘rib chiqdim.

298
00:15:31,402 --> 00:15:34,640
Kichik cho‘ntak ichida nima bor?

299
00:15:34,663 --> 00:15:37,152
Cho‘ntakmi?

300
00:15:37,176 --> 00:15:39,409
A, topdim!

301
00:15:39,432 --> 00:15:41,565
Shu yerda ekan.

302
00:15:41,588 --> 00:15:43,388
Yaxshi boʻldi.

303
00:15:43,411 --> 00:15:45,978
Topilgani uchun xotirjam bo‘ldim.

304
00:15:46,001 --> 00:15:49,134
Rostdan uzr so‘rayman.

305
00:15:49,157 --> 00:15:50,657
Sahna 9: Hojatxona suv sizishi muammosini hal qilish

306
00:15:50,657 --> 00:15:54,191
Alo, boshqaruv kompaniyasi misiz?

307
00:15:54,214 --> 00:15:56,816
Ha, shunday.

308
00:15:56,839 --> 00:15:58,613
Nima bo‘ldi?

309
00:15:58,636 --> 00:16:02,203
Hojatxonadagi suv to‘xtamayapti.

310
00:16:02,226 --> 00:16:05,294
Suv doim oqayapti, shundaymi?

311
00:16:05,317 --> 00:16:09,084
Ha, ko‘p oqayapti.

312
00:16:09,107 --> 00:16:11,707
Pol ho‘l bo‘lganmi?

313
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:15,863
Ha, pol suv bilan to‘lib ketgan.

314
00:16:15,886 --> 00:16:17,553
Tushunarli.

315
00:16:17,576 --> 00:16:21,109
Avvalo asosiy kranni yoping.

316
00:16:21,132 --> 00:16:23,699
Asosiy kran...?

317
00:16:23,722 --> 00:16:27,522
Kechirasiz, bilmayman.

318
00:16:27,545 --> 00:16:32,345
Suvni to‘xtatadigan kichik tutqich.

319
00:16:32,368 --> 00:16:34,934
Hojatxona bakining tagida bor.

320
00:16:34,957 --> 00:16:37,557
Bakining tagida...

321
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,514
A, bu-mi?

322
00:16:40,537 --> 00:16:44,070
Ammo qattiq, aylanmayapti.

323
00:16:44,093 --> 00:16:46,696
Asbobingiz bormi?

324
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,795
Asbob?

325
00:16:48,818 --> 00:16:53,384
Kechirasiz, so‘zlarni tushunmayapman.

326
00:16:53,407 --> 00:16:57,343
Otvyortka yoki gayka kaliti kabi asboblar.

327
00:16:57,367 --> 00:17:00,824
Yo‘q, asbobim yo‘q.

328
00:17:00,848 --> 00:17:02,814
Tushunarli.

329
00:17:02,837 --> 00:17:06,087
Tez orada ta’mirlovchi keladi.

330
00:17:06,111 --> 00:17:08,524
Qancha vaqtda keladi?

331
00:17:08,548 --> 00:17:12,036
Uch oʻn daqiqada borish mumkin.

332
00:17:12,059 --> 00:17:14,912
Iltimos, tezroq keling.

333
00:17:14,935 --> 00:17:17,701
Suv xonaga chiqyapti.

334
00:17:17,724 --> 00:17:19,891
Shoshilintirib yuboraman.

335
00:17:19,914 --> 00:17:22,482
Suvni sochiq bilan arting.

336
00:17:22,506 --> 00:17:24,577
Tushunarli.

337
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,979
Sochiqdan foydalanaman.

338
00:17:27,003 --> 00:17:30,736
Hozir boraman, shuning uchun kutib turing.

339
00:17:30,759 --> 00:17:33,126
Iltimos, yordam bering.

340
00:17:33,149 --> 00:17:34,649
10-sahna: Zilzila paytida qanday harakat qilish kerak / Zilzila paytida qanday javob berish kerak

341
00:17:34,649 --> 00:17:37,582
Voy, zilzila!

342
00:17:37,605 --> 00:17:39,699
Tebranyapti.

343
00:17:39,723 --> 00:17:41,856
Vaziyatni saqlang.

344
00:17:41,879 --> 00:17:45,049
Stol ostiga kiring.

345
00:17:45,073 --> 00:17:48,212
Qoʻrqaman, nima qilsam?

346
00:17:48,235 --> 00:17:50,082
Hammasi yaxshi boʻladi.

347
00:17:50,106 --> 00:17:52,873
Boshni yoping.

348
00:17:52,896 --> 00:17:56,181
Tebranish juda kuchli.

349
00:17:56,204 --> 00:18:00,541
Tezda toʻxtaydi, shuning uchun harakatlanmang.

350
00:18:00,565 --> 00:18:02,898
Toʻxtaydimi…?

351
00:18:02,921 --> 00:18:07,321
Zilzila toʻxtaydi degani.

352
00:18:07,344 --> 00:18:10,615
A, tebranish toʻxtadi.

353
00:18:10,639 --> 00:18:13,135
Yaxshi boʻldi.

354
00:18:13,159 --> 00:18:15,425
Jarohatingiz bormi?

355
00:18:15,448 --> 00:18:18,248
Ha, hammasi yaxshi.

356
00:18:18,271 --> 00:18:20,838
Lekin qoʻrqaman.

357
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:23,828
Keyin qayerga borish kerak?

358
00:18:23,851 --> 00:18:26,984
Tashqariga chiqsam yaxshi boʻladi mi?

359
00:18:27,007 --> 00:18:31,740
Yoʻq, tashqarida oynalar tushishi xavfli.

360
00:18:31,763 --> 00:18:34,763
Shunday boʻlsa, shu yerda qolaylikmi?

361
00:18:34,786 --> 00:18:39,120
Televizorni yoqib, maʼlumot olamiz.

362
00:18:39,142 --> 00:18:40,909
Maʼlumot?

363
00:18:40,932 --> 00:18:43,509
Yangiliklar degani.

364
00:18:43,533 --> 00:18:46,171
Zilzila yangiliklarini koʻramiz.

365
00:18:46,194 --> 00:18:48,527
Tushunarli.

366
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:50,750
Suv toshqini keladimi?

367
00:18:50,773 --> 00:18:55,632
Bu yer dengizdan uzoq, shuning uchun xavfsiz.

368
00:18:55,655 --> 00:18:57,990
Boshpana joyiga boraylikmi?

369
00:18:58,014 --> 00:18:59,947
Boshpana joyi?

370
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:03,170
Xavfsiz joy degani.

371
00:19:03,193 --> 00:19:05,360
Maktabga boramiz.

372
00:19:05,383 --> 00:19:08,149
Birga borib berolmaysizmi?

373
00:19:08,172 --> 00:19:11,572
Ha, birga boramiz.

374
00:19:11,595 --> 00:19:13,873
Yukingizni olib boring.

375
00:19:13,897 --> 00:19:15,744
Tushunarli.

376
00:19:15,767 --> 00:19:18,101
Tashakkur.